  - NodeGUID: c096dc7a-b58b-45bf-a1a5-b26f84d871cb
    ActorText: Me
    DialogueText: She said you have to become her friend and then she will give you
      back your cheese
    Position: {x: 210.4, y: 183.20001}
  - NodeGUID: c4161349-74d0-47fe-a21c-440ffe11f7c9
